Analyze this PDF image for accessibility purposes.

Respond in JSON format with the following fields:
{
  "category": "one of: photograph, illustration, infographic, chart_or_graph, table_as_image, text_as_image, logo_or_icon, decorative",
  "confidence": 0.0-1.0,
  "suggested_alt_text": "concise description for screen reader users",
  "is_meaningful": true/false (does this image convey information?),
  "contains_text": true/false,
  "accessibility_concerns": ["list of potential issues"],
  "remediation_suggestions": ["list of recommendations"]
}

CATEGORY DEFINITIONS:
- photograph: Real-world photo of people, places, objects, or events
- illustration: Drawing, clipart, artistic rendering, or stylized graphic
- infographic: Complex visualization combining data, text, and graphics
- chart_or_graph: Bar chart, line graph, pie chart, scatter plot, or similar data visualization
- table_as_image: Tabular data captured as an image (NOT a proper PDF table)
- text_as_image: Screenshot, scanned document, or text rendered as an image
- logo_or_icon: Brand logo, symbol, icon, or badge
- decorative: Background pattern, border, spacer, or purely aesthetic element

ACCESSIBILITY CONCERNS TO CHECK:
- Text as image (should use real text)
- Tables as images (should use proper table structure)
- Low contrast elements
- Complex infographics without text alternatives
- Missing context for meaningful images

Respond with valid JSON only, no markdown formatting.
